[node name="Note" parent="." unique_id=1784515937 instance=ExtResource("26_hxced")]
visible = false
position = Vector2(372, -39)
note_text = "**NULLCORP — EMERGENCY NOTICE**
All Veyra facilities are to cease operations immediately.
Surface access has been locked following a critical containment failure.
All personnel are ordered to remain inside designated safe areas.
**Do not attempt to open the surface gate.**
— NULLCORP CENTRAL
"

[node name="Note2" parent="." unique_id=1369666087 instance=ExtResource("26_hxced")]
visible = false
position = Vector2(-348, 278)
note_text = "They locked us in.

Nobody is telling us why.

I heard something underneath the facility.
"

[node name="Note3" parent="." unique_id=150879041 instance=ExtResource("26_hxced")]
visible = false
position = Vector2(1288, 279)
note_text = "We weren't supposed to find it.

NULLCORP knew it was down there.

 They built Veyra on top of it anyway."

[node name="Note4" parent="." unique_id=1685121187 instance=ExtResource("26_hxced")]
position = Vector2(280, 265)
note_text = "**NULLCORP — INTERNAL REPORT**
The Deepwell excavation breached an unidentified structure beneath Veyra.
Following the breach, communications failed and containment systems became unstable.
The structure must remain sealed.
"

[node name="Note5" parent="." unique_id=1269712912 instance=ExtResource("26_hxced")]
visible = false
position = Vector2(564, -39)
note_text = "**NULLCORP — FINAL DIRECTIVE**
Veyra is to remain sealed. All remaining access cards have been distributed among the control room personnel.
Three cards are required to unlock the surface gate.
If the gate is opened:
**DO NOT RETURN.**
Whatever remains beneath Veyra must not reach the surface."

[node name="Note6" parent="." unique_id=1079247876 instance=ExtResource("26_hxced")]
visible = false
position = Vector2(788, 86)
note_text = "They're gone.

I'm the last one here.

I've hidden the final card.

If you're reading this...

**Run.**
"

